 that was eliminated) the same way." (cons "" (cons "`#same` of two terms, either of them a checked definition or `the T t`, reads both at that" (cons "one type, so equal values compare equal however they are written. Other readings (`#show` and" (cons "`#same` of any other terms) are taken without a type: under a binder," (cons "a variable's type is not known, so a path variable stays stuck at an endpoint and nothing is" (cons "η-expanded. `#same` compares two readings as text: on well-typed terms equal texts are equal" (cons "values; two readings can differ while their values are equal." nil))))))))))))))))))))))))))))
